---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Credits and licences">
  <h1>Credits and licences</h1>
  <p class="lede">Who and what made this site, under which licences, and what we do and don’t collect.</p>
  <section id="licence" aria-labelledby="licence-title">
    <h2 id="licence-title">This site and the kit</h2>
    <p>Apache-2.0. Impeccable (Apache-2.0, © Paul Bakaus) is vendored with its NOTICE.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="tools" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
    <h2 id="tools-title">Tools and skills</h2>
    <p>Astro, Playwright, ComfyUI, axe, Lighthouse, Impeccable.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="models" aria-labelledby="models-title">
    <h2 id="models-title">Image models</h2>
    <p>Placeholder: the model and licence table from the image sidecars, written in Phase 5.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="diamond" aria-labelledby="diamond-title">
    <h2 id="diamond-title">The Double Diamond</h2>
    <p>Double Diamond by the Design Council, CC BY 4.0, adapted.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy</h2>
    <p>No cookies and no analytics. If you press Reduce motion, that choice is kept in your browser’s local storage, and nowhere else.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="accessibility" aria-labelledby="accessibility-title">
    <h2 id="accessibility-title">Accessibility statement</h2>
    <p>Target: WCAG 2.2 AA. Test results are published here after the Gate 4 audit.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="ai-imagery" aria-labelledby="ai-imagery-title">
    <h2 id="ai-imagery-title">AI-generated imagery</h2>
    <p>Placeholder: which images are generated, with which model and workflow, written once the images exist.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 { margin-block-end: var(--space-s); }
  .lede { color: var(--color-ink-muted); margin-block-end: var(--space-xl); }
  section { display: grid; gap: var(--space-s); padding-block: var(--space-l); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
</style>
